Meta.documentation:var
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Declares a typed name in the enclosing scope.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:var:Type:name looks the type up as a new object and instantiates it under
Meta.documentation:name in the enclosing scope's context (the script's Flow/List), so name:
Meta.documentation:resolves like any other resource URI. As the declared type of value flows
Meta.documentation:through the declaration it is captured; a reference name: routes each call
Meta.documentation:into the currently captured value - e.g. json:>>con: streams the reply into
Meta.documentation:whichever connection was captured this request. Referencing the same name
Meta.documentation:twice yields the same instance, never a second instantiation.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A qualified reference (name:<tail>, e.g. connection:file:public) is a live
Meta.documentation:subscription with a VIA: on every capture the pump completes the tail
Meta.documentation:URI with the captured request's path (file:public + /x ->
Meta.documentation:file:public/x?read), loads it through the dawn tree and streams the
Meta.documentation:result into the connection's response - the static-mount pattern ("/"
Meta.documentation:serves index.html, ".." answers 403, a miss stays silent so the
Meta.documentation:connection answers itself the default). Values without a request url
Meta.documentation:make the pump a no-op.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A sub-path through the reference (name.<child>:<tail>, e.g.
Meta.documentation:connection.route:file:public) resolves the child resource normally and
Meta.documentation:wraps it in a subscription proxy: each captured value is fed into the
Meta.documentation:resolved instance by its type (in_<Type>_$all) - that is how the
Meta.documentation:httpConnection.route via-mount receives each request. See
Meta.documentation:httpConnection.route for the via semantics (file:public + request path).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_<Type>_$all - captures a value of the declared type (per event)
Meta.documentation:@port out_<Type> - the captured value, forwarded downstream
Meta.documentation:@see Reference
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20var%3A%3CType%3E%3A%3Cname%3E%20%20looks%20up%20%3CType%3E%20as%20a%20new%20object%2C%20instantiates%20it%20under%0A%2F%2F%20%3Cname%3E%2C%20and%20introduces%20%3Cname%3E%3A%20into%20the%20script's%20scope%20(the%20top-level%0A%2F%2F%20program%20container%20the%20declaration%20lives%20in)%2C%20so%20later%20lines%20and%20later%0A%2F%2F%20elements%20in%20the%20same%20flow%20can%20reference%20it.%0A%2F%2F%0A%2F%2F%20At%20run%20time%20the%20declaration%20captures%20each%20value%20that%20flows%20through%20and%0A%2F%2F%20forwards%20it%20downstream.%20A%20reference%20%3Cname%3E%3A%20works%20in%20both%20directions%3A%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20sink%20%20%20-%20...%3E%3E%3Cname%3E%3A%20%20%20%20routes%20each%20incoming%20call%20into%20the%20currently%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20captured%20value's%20matching%20in_*%20port%20(the%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20httpConnection%20reply%20pattern)%0A%2F%2F%20%20%20source%20-%20%3Cname%3E%3A%3E%3E...%20%20%20%20on%20go%2C%20replays%20the%20captured%20value%20downstream%0A%2F%2F%20A%20QUALIFIED%20reference%20(%3Cname%3E%3A%3Ctail%3E%2C%20e.g.%20connection%3Afile%3Apublic)%20is%20a%0A%2F%2F%20live%20subscription%20with%20a%20VIA%3A%20it%20registers%20with%20the%20declaring%20element%20and%0A%2F%2F%20on%20every%20capture%20the%20pump%20completes%20the%20tail%20URI%20with%20the%20captured%0A%2F%2F%20request's%20path%20(file%3Apublic%20%2B%20%2Fx%20-%3E%20file%3Apublic%2Fx%3Fread)%2C%20loads%20it%20through%0A%2F%2F%20the%20dawn%20tree%20and%20streams%20the%20result%20into%20the%20connection's%20response%20%E2%80%94%0A%2F%2F%20the%20static-mount%20pattern%20(%22%2F%22%20serves%20index.html%2C%20%22..%22%20answers%20403%2C%20a%20miss%0A%2F%2F%20stays%20silent%20so%20the%20connection%20answers%20itself%20the%20default).%20Values%0A%2F%2F%20without%20a%20request%20url%20make%20the%20pump%20a%20no-op.%0A%2F%2F%20A%20SUB-PATH%20through%20the%20reference%20(%3Cname%3E.%3Cchild%3E%3A%3Ctail%3E%2C%20e.g.%0A%2F%2F%20connection.route%3Afile%3Apublic)%20resolves%20the%20child%20resource%20normally%20and%0A%2F%2F%20wraps%20it%20in%20a%20subscription%20proxy%3A%20each%20captured%20value%20is%20fed%20into%20the%0A%2F%2F%20resolved%20instance%20by%20its%20type%20(in_%3CType%3E_%24all)%20%E2%80%94%20that%20is%20how%20the%0A%2F%2F%20httpConnection.route%20gate%2Fvia%20receives%20each%20request.%20See%0A%2F%2F%20httpConnection.route%20for%20the%20via%20semantics.%0A%2F%2F%20The%20capture%20awaits%20the%20downstream%20chain%20(Dawn-promise%20continuation%2C%20the%0A%2F%2F%20execute%2Fexecute_fn%20pattern)%2C%20so%20async%20work%20(file%20loads%2C%20http%20fetches)%0A%2F%2F%20completes%20before%20the%20request%20end%20event%20propagates.%0Afunction%20_var()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22var%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20varProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Processor%20for%20a%20REFERENCE%20to%20a%20var-introduced%20name%20(%3Cname%3E%3A).%20The%0A%2F%2F%20introduced%20resource%20lives%20in%20the%20scope's%20children%3B%20instantiating%20it%20yields%0A%2F%2F%20this%20per-reference%20delegate%20bound%20to%20the%20declaring%20element.%0Afunction%20varReferenceProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2C%20resource)%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20pre-declare%20the%20typed%20output%20so%20connecting%20as%20a%20source%20wires%20it%20up%0A%09if%20(resource.varType)%0A%09%09this%5B%22out_%22%20%2B%20resource.varType%5D%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_begin%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_end%20%20%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20sub-paths%20through%20the%20reference%20(connection.route%3A...)%3A%20resolve%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20child%20normally%2C%20then%20wrap%20it%20in%20a%20subscription%20proxy%20%E2%80%94%20the%20capture%0A%09%2F%2F%20broadcast%20feeds%20the%20resolved%20instance%20with%20each%20captured%20value%0A%09this.previousLookup%20%3D%20this.lookup_new%3B%0A%09this.lookup_new%20%3D%20async%20function(identifier%2C%20searchToRoot)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20result%20%3D%20await%20this.previousLookup(identifier%2C%20searchToRoot)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(result%20%26%26%20typeof%20identifier%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22string%22%20%26%26%20identifier.indexOf(resource.name%20%2B%20%22.%22)%20%3D%3D%3D%200)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20owner%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09%09const%20proxy%20%3D%20%7B%0A%09%09%09%09isVarSubscription%3A%20true%2C%0A%09%09%09%09target%3A%20result%2C%0A%09%09%09%09get_resource%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20result.get_resource%20%3F%20result.get_resource()%20%3A%20resource%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09instanciate_processor%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20this%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09default_processor%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20this%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09set_owner%3A%20function()%20%7B%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09get_output_types%3A%20function()%0A%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(this.target%20%26%26%20this.target.get_output_types)%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09return%20this.target.get_output_types()%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09return%20new%20Set()%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09connect%3A%20function(next)%20%7B%20if%20(this.target)%20this.target.connect(next)%3B%20return%20next%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09offer_connection%3A%20function(match)%0A%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(this.target%20%26%26%20this.target.offer_connection)%0A%09%09%09%09%09%09return%20this.target.offer_connection(match)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09return%20undefined%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09in_begin%3A%20function()%20%7B%20this.target%3F.in_begin%3F.()%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09in_end%3A%20%20%20function()%20%7B%20this.target%3F.in_end%3F.()%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09%09in_go%3A%20%20%20%20function()%20%7B%7D%2C%20%2F%2F%20capture-driven%2C%20never%20program-start%20go%0A%09%09%09%09%2F%2F%20per%20capture%3A%20feed%20the%20captured%20value%20into%20the%20target%20by%20type%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%2F%2F%20the%20result%20(an%20async%20chain's%20promise)%20propagates%20to%20the%20caller%0A%09%09%09%09onCapture%3A%20function()%0A%09%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09%09const%20c%20%3D%20owner.captured()%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(!c%20%7C%7C%20!this.target)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09const%20typeName%20%3D%20c.get_resource%20%3F%20c.get_resource().name%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(!typeName)%20return%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09const%20fn%20%3D%20this.target%5B%22in_%22%20%2B%20typeName%20%2B%20%22_%24all%22%5D%20%7C%7C%20this.target%5B%22in_%22%20%2B%20typeName%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%09if%20(fn)%20return%20fn.call(this.target%2C%20c)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09%09resource.subscribers%20%3D%20resource.subscribers%20%7C%7C%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(resource.subscribers.indexOf(proxy)%20%3D%3D%3D%20-1)%0A%09%09%09%09resource.subscribers.push(proxy)%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20proxy%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20result%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20delegate%20object%3A%20runtime%20indirection%20to%20the%20declaring%20element's%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20currently%20captured%20value%20(the%20captured%20value%20is%20replaced%20per%20event)%0A%09%09const%20self%20%3D%20this%3B%0A%09%09const%20outType%20%3D%20resource.varType%20%3F%20%22out_%22%20%2B%20resource.varType%20%3A%20null%3B%0A%09%09let%20uriTail%20%3D%20(input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20uriTail%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(uriTail)%3B%20%7D%20catch%20(e)%20%7B%7D%0A%09%09return%20%7B%0A%09%09%09isVarReference%3A%20true%2C%0A%09%09%09uriTail%3A%20uriTail%2C%0A%09%09%09get_resource%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20resource%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09instanciate_processor%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20this%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09default_processor%3A%20function()%20%7B%20return%20this%3B%20%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09set_owner%3A%20function()%20%7B%7D%2C%0A%09%09%09inputList%3A